    maxLengthHint: 72
  - textKey: dialogue.tutorial.operator_supply_container.line_01
    korean: "\uBCF4\uAE09 \uCEE8\uD14C\uC774\uB108\uB97C \uCC3E\uC558\uC5B4. \uC811\uADFC\uD574\uC11C
      \uD30C\uAD34\uD558\uACE0 \uC790\uC6D0\uC744 \uD68C\uC218\uD574."
    english: 
    japanese: 
    simplifiedChinese: 
    traditionalChinese: 
    context: Tutorial supply-container guidance
    notes: Starts after the owner-scoped camera finishes focusing the discovered
      target
    maxLengthHint: 72
  - textKey: dialogue.tutorial.rescue_after_curse.line_01
    korean: "\u2026\uC774\uC81C \uB4E4\uB824?"
    english: "\u2026Can you hear me now?"
    japanese: 
    simplifiedChinese: 
    traditionalChinese: 
    context: Tutorial rescue line 1 after communication recovery
    notes: Approved Phase 2C Korean source
    maxLengthHint: 21
  - textKey: dialogue.tutorial.rescue_after_curse.line_02
    korean: "\uC911\uACC4\uAE30\uB97C \uAC74\uB4DC\uB9B0 \uB4A4\uBD80\uD130 \uB124
      \uCC44\uB110\uC774 \uC644\uC804\uD788 \uB04A\uACA8 \uC788\uC5C8\uC5B4. \uB124
      \uCABD\uC5D0\uC120 \uB204\uAC00 \uB9D0\uD55C \uAC70\uC57C?"
    english: I lost your channel after you touched the relay. Who was talking to
      you?
    japanese: 
    simplifiedChinese: 
    traditionalChinese: 
    context: Tutorial rescue line 2 after communication recovery
    notes: Approved Phase 2C Korean source
    maxLengthHint: 72
  - textKey: dialogue.tutorial.rescue_after_curse.line_03
    korean: "\uAE30\uCCB4 \uD45C\uBA74\uC5D0 \uC815\uCCB4\uBD88\uBA85\uC758 \uC811\uC18D
      \uD328\uD134\uC774 \uBC88\uC9C0\uACE0 \uC788\uC5B4. \uD68C\uC218 \uC2E0\uD638\uB97C
      \uC5F4\uC5C8\uC5B4. \uB2F9\uC7A5 \uB3CC\uC544\uC640."
    english: An unknown access pattern is spreading across your hull. The recovery
      signal is open. Return now.
    japanese: 
    simplifiedChinese: 
    traditionalChinese: 
    context: Tutorial rescue line 3 requesting existing return flow
    notes: Approved Phase 2C Korean source
    maxLengthHint: 97
  - textKey: dialogue.tutorial.signal_relay_analysis.line_01
    korean: "\uC911\uACC4\uAE30 \uC811\uC18D \uD655\uC778. \uB04A\uC5B4\uC9C4 \uD1B5\uC2E0\uB9DD\uC744
      \uC6B0\uD68C \uC5F0\uACB0 \uC911\uC774\uC57C."
    english: Relay connection confirmed. Rerouting around the broken network.
    japanese: 
    simplifiedChinese: 
    traditionalChinese: 
    context: Tutorial signal-relay analysis line 1
    notes: Real Operator confirms authoritative relay analysis
    maxLengthHint: 64
  - textKey: dialogue.tutorial.signal_relay_analysis.line_02
    korean: "\uC7A0\uAE50, \uB2E4\uB978 \uC2E0\uD638\uAC00 \uCC44\uB110\uC744 \uB09A\uC544\uCC44\uACE0
      \uC788\uC5B4\u2014"
    english: "Wait, another signal is hijacking the channel\u2014"
    japanese: 
    simplifiedChinese: 
    traditionalChinese: 
    context: Tutorial signal-relay analysis line 2
    notes: Real Operator transmission cuts off before the fake takeover
    maxLengthHint: 56
